    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Doctor with swept brown hair, a beard and wire glasses, wearing an open white lab coat over blue scrubs, a stethoscope around the neck, a pen pocket and plain white trainers. The coat has a proper back vent, collar and lapels, and the rear views confirm the coat and scrub trousers continue cleanly. A close crop of the footwear confirms the trainers are unbranded: white uppers with a blue sole and no logo or swoosh. Proportions are deliberately stylised with long legs, which is why style fit is 4 against a realism-first brief. Rigged: 54-bone humanoid armature (24 body + 30 finger bones), walk and run clips, zero unweighted skinned vertices.",
